          "html": "A charged <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Amulet_of_glory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">amulet of glory</a> or an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Broomstick\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">enchanted broomstick</a> for quick teleportation to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Shantay_Pass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shantay Pass</a>",
