            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "statuette:1kjbntd:12nc55j",
              "html": "Alternatively, you can use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dig_Site_pendant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dig Site pendant</a>&#39;s Senntisten Temple teleport option.",
